From 57e1a0cb5a5139330f92075af0cf3ae3d6167c71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Ponguta <sergioponguta@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:23:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(kovalla): folder poster trailers fall back to the
 meta addons

- Collection folders build items from TMDB with `tmdb:<id>`; the trailer pipeline only
  consulted TMDB, which is off in this profile, and the screen never passes a YT fallback,
  so hovering a poster played nothing.
- When both come back empty, translate the id to IMDb (the only shape addons answer to) and
  ask the meta addons for a trailer, then resolve it through the existing YouTube path.
- Keeps the debounce, request-version guard, single in-flight job and negative cache intact;
  cancellation is rethrown rather than swallowed so a stale request cannot cache a miss.
---
